{"id":8867158261959,"title":"Christmas Bedding Quilt – Soft Microfiber Holiday Bedsprea - Design 11","handle":"christmas-bedding-quilt-soft-microfiber-holiday-bedsprea-design-11","description":"\u003cp\u003eWelcome the festive season with the Jeminise Christmas Quilt, designed to bring warmth and holiday cheer to your home. Crafted from premium microfiber, this quilt offers an exceptionally soft, breathable, and comfortable experience. Its lightweight yet durable fabric ensures coziness throughout the year, while vibrant festive prints infuse your decor with a joyful holiday spirit. Perfect as a thoughtful gift, it’s ideal for Christmas, winter birthdays, anniversaries, or any holiday gathering, serving beautifully as a bedspread, a festive couch throw, or a warm companion for chilly nights.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFestive Holiday Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features bright, high-quality Christmas prints to create a warm, joyful atmosphere, perfect for bedrooms, living rooms, or holiday setups.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePremium Comfort:\u003c\/strong\u003e Made of soft, lightweight microfiber, providing warmth in winter and coolness in warmer months for year-round versatility.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMultiple Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Available in Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to perfectly fit beds, sofas, or as a decorative seasonal quilt.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThoughtful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e A cozy and meaningful present for loved ones during Christmas, New Year, birthdays, or other holiday celebrations.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable with cold water on a gentle cycle, tumble dry low or air dry. Fade-resistant and wrinkle-free for lasting softness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\